## Verification notes

- **"Processing" is real, not a counter snapshot**: `in flight at bucket end = started(t<end) − finished(t<end)`, from two sorted arrays + binary search. An open call lands in the last bucket immediately and retroactively fills every bucket it spanned once it settles.
- **Alignment**: local entries are bucketed on the *local-time* grid (`bucketStartOf`), matching `periodToMs(period)` of the backend rows; `bucketSizeFor()` reads the precision of the returned period, so a coarser fallback grouping cannot misalign the overlay.
- **No fake zeros**: buckets closed before the oldest retained entry are `null`, Chart.js breaks the line, and the tooltip prints `—`.
- **Retention**: `CLIENT_LOG_TTL_MS = 1h`, pruned on every push *and* on every load (idle tabs). `CLIENT_LOG_LIMIT = 5000` is now only a burst guard.
- **Perf**: one pass over the buffer per recompute (≤5000 entries) + one binary search per bucket; no O(rows × entries) scan on every request.
- **Accessibility**: the new axis is labelled (`y2Title`), the local series rely on dash + color (never color alone), the in-flight badge and clear buttons keep `title`/`aria-label`.

